{"seq":2,"slug":"memory-layout","title":"内存布局与零成本抽象","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-language/systems-programming/memory-layout","wordCount":838,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"内存布局与零成本抽象\">内存布局与零成本抽象</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>内存布局决定了数据在内存中实际占用的字节与对齐方式，是理解性能、FFI 与二进制协议的基础。理解本篇的关键，是记住 Rust 默认<strong>不承诺字段顺序</strong>——编译器可自由重排以最小化大小，而 <code>#[repr]</code> 正是你收回这一控制权的唯一途径。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>对齐即填充</strong>：字段需按自身对齐放置，字段顺序直接影响填充字节数，因此重排能显著缩小结构体。</li>\n<li><strong>空位优化（Niche）</strong>：编译器识别&quot;存在非法位模式&quot;的类型，把 <code>Option&lt;&amp;T&gt;</code> 压缩到与 <code>&amp;T</code> 同样大小。</li>\n<li><strong>胖指针携带元数据</strong>：<code>&amp;[T]</code>、<code>&amp;str</code>、<code>&amp;dyn Trait</code> 都是 16 字节，额外的长度或虚表指针是动态能力的代价。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"类型的内存大小\">类型的内存大小</h2><p>Rust 中每个类型都有确定的大小（<code>size</code>）和对齐（<code>align</code>）。编译器会在字段间插入填充字节以满足对齐要求。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use std::mem;&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    println!(&quot;i8:  size={}, align={}&quot;, mem::size_of::&lt;i8&gt;(), mem::align_of::&lt;i8&gt;());&#10;    println!(&quot;i32: size={}, align={}&quot;, mem::size_of::&lt;i32&gt;(), mem::align_of::&lt;i32&gt;());&#10;    println!(&quot;i64: size={}, align={}&quot;, mem::size_of::&lt;i64&gt;(), mem::align_of::&lt;i64&gt;());&#10;    println!(&quot;&amp;str: size={}&quot;, mem::size_of::&lt;&amp;str&gt;());&#10;    println!(&quot;String: size={}&quot;, mem::size_of::&lt;String&gt;());&#10;    println!(&quot;Vec&lt;i32&gt;: size={}&quot;, mem::size_of::&lt;Vec&lt;i32&gt;&gt;());&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use std::mem;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"i8:  size={}, align={}\", mem::size_of::&#x3C;i8>(), mem::align_of::&#x3C;i8>());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"i32: size={}, align={}\", mem::size_of::&#x3C;i32>(), mem::align_of::&#x3C;i32>());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"i64: size={}, align={}\", mem::size_of::&#x3C;i64>(), mem::align_of::&#x3C;i64>());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"&#x26;str: size={}\", mem::size_of::&#x3C;&#x26;str>());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"String: size={}\", mem::size_of::&#x3C;String>());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"Vec&#x3C;i32>: size={}\", mem::size_of::&#x3C;Vec&#x3C;i32>>());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>常见类型大小（64 位系统）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>大小（字节）</th>\n<th>对齐（字节）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>bool</code></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>i32</code> / <code>u32</code></td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>i64</code> / <code>f64</code></td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>8</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&amp;T</code></td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>8</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&amp;str</code></td>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>8</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>String</code></td>\n<td>24</td>\n<td>8</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Vec&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n<td>24</td>\n<td>8</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Option&lt;&amp;T&gt;</code></td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>8</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><code>Option&lt;&amp;T&gt;</code> 与 <code>&amp;T</code> 大小相同，因为编译器利用了&quot;引用不可能为 null&quot;的特性进行<strong>空位优化</strong>（Niche Optimization）。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"结构体布局与-repr\">结构体布局与 repr</h2><p>默认情况下，Rust 编译器可以自由重排结构体字段以优化大小。使用 <code>#[repr]</code> 属性可以精确控制布局。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"#[repr(C)]&#10;struct CLayout {&#10;    a: u8,&#10;    b: u32,&#10;    c: u8,&#10;}&#10;&#10;#[repr(packed)]&#10;struct Packed {&#10;    a: u8,&#10;    b: u32,&#10;    c: u8,&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    println!(&quot;默认: {}&quot;, std::mem::size_of::&lt;(u8, u32, u8)&gt;());&#10;    println!(&quot;#[repr(C)]: {}&quot;, std::mem::size_of::&lt;CLayout&gt;());&#10;    println!(&quot;#[repr(packed)]: {}&quot;, std::mem::size_of::&lt;Packed&gt;());&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>#[repr(C)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct CLayout {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    a: u8,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    b: u32,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    c: u8,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[repr(packed)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct Packed {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    a: u8,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    b: u32,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    c: u8,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"默认: {}\", std::mem::size_of::&#x3C;(u8, u32, u8)>());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"#[repr(C)]: {}\", std::mem::size_of::&#x3C;CLayout>());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"#[repr(packed)]: {}\", std::mem::size_of::&#x3C;Packed>());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>repr 属性</th>\n<th>布局规则</th>\n<th>大小</th>\n<th>使用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>默认</td>\n<td>编译器自由优化</td>\n<td>最小</td>\n<td>一般 Rust 代码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>#[repr(C)]</code></td>\n<td>按 C 语言规则排列</td>\n<td>含填充</td>\n<td>FFI 互操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>#[repr(packed)]</code></td>\n<td>去除填充</td>\n<td>最紧凑</td>\n<td>二进制协议解析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>#[repr(align(N))]</code></td>\n<td>保证最小对齐为 N</td>\n<td>≥ N</td>\n<td>缓存行对齐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>#[repr(transparent)]</code></td>\n<td>与内部单字段完全相同</td>\n<td>同内部类型</td>\n<td>newtype 模式</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"枚举布局与判别式\">枚举布局与判别式</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use std::mem;&#10;&#10;enum Color {&#10;    Red,&#10;    Green,&#10;    Blue,&#10;}&#10;&#10;enum Shape {&#10;    Circle(f64),&#10;    Rectangle(f64, f64),&#10;    Point,&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    println!(&quot;Color: size={}&quot;, mem::size_of::&lt;Color&gt;());&#10;    println!(&quot;Shape: size={}&quot;, mem::size_of::&lt;Shape&gt;());&#10;    println!(&quot;Option&lt;bool&gt;: size={}&quot;, mem::size_of::&lt;Option&lt;bool&gt;&gt;());&#10;    println!(&quot;Option&lt;&amp;i32&gt;: size={}&quot;, mem::size_of::&lt;Option&lt;&amp;i32&gt;&gt;());&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use std::mem;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>enum Color {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Red,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Green,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Blue,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>enum Shape {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Circle(f64),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Rectangle(f64, f64),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Point,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"Color: size={}\", mem::size_of::&#x3C;Color>());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"Shape: size={}\", mem::size_of::&#x3C;Shape>());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"Option&#x3C;bool>: size={}\", mem::size_of::&#x3C;Option&#x3C;bool>>());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"Option&#x3C;&#x26;i32>: size={}\", mem::size_of::&#x3C;Option&#x3C;&#x26;i32>>());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;枚举内存布局&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;判别式 (discriminant)&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;最大变体的数据&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; D[&quot;标记当前是哪个变体&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; E[&quot;所有变体共享同一空间&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"枚举内存布局\"] --&gt; B[\"判别式 (discriminant)\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"最大变体的数据\"]\n    B --&gt; D[\"标记当前是哪个变体\"]\n    C --&gt; E[\"所有变体共享同一空间\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"零大小类型-zst\">零大小类型（ZST）</h2><p>零大小类型不占用内存，但在类型系统中具有意义。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use std::mem;&#10;&#10;struct Unit;&#10;struct PhantomState;&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    println!(&quot;(): size={}&quot;, mem::size_of::&lt;()&gt;());&#10;    println!(&quot;Unit: size={}&quot;, mem::size_of::&lt;Unit&gt;());&#10;    println!(&quot;[i32; 0]: size={}&quot;, mem::size_of::&lt;[i32; 0]&gt;());&#10;    println!(&quot;PhantomData&lt;i32&gt;: size={}&quot;, mem::size_of::&lt;std::marker::PhantomData&lt;i32&gt;&gt;());&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use std::mem;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct Unit;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct PhantomState;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"(): size={}\", mem::size_of::&#x3C;()>());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"Unit: size={}\", mem::size_of::&#x3C;Unit>());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"[i32; 0]: size={}\", mem::size_of::&#x3C;[i32; 0]>());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"PhantomData&#x3C;i32>: size={}\", mem::size_of::&#x3C;std::marker::PhantomData&#x3C;i32>>());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>ZST 类型</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>()</code></td>\n<td>函数无返回值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>PhantomData&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n<td>类型状态标记</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>struct Marker;</code></td>\n<td>类型级别的标签</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>[T; 0]</code></td>\n<td>泛型约束中的占位</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"胖指针\">胖指针</h2><p>某些引用需要额外的元数据，被称为&quot;胖指针&quot;，占用两个指针的大小。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指针类型</th>\n<th>大小</th>\n<th>额外元数据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>&amp;T</code>（Sized）</td>\n<td>8 字节</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&amp;[T]</code></td>\n<td>16 字节</td>\n<td>切片长度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&amp;str</code></td>\n<td>16 字节</td>\n<td>字符串长度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&amp;dyn Trait</code></td>\n<td>16 字节</td>\n<td>vtable 指针</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Box&lt;dyn Trait&gt;</code></td>\n<td>16 字节</td>\n<td>vtable 指针</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use std::mem;&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    let s = &quot;hello&quot;;&#10;    let r: &amp;str = s;&#10;    println!(&quot;&amp;i32 size: {}&quot;, mem::size_of::&lt;&amp;i32&gt;());&#10;    println!(&quot;&amp;str size: {}&quot;, mem::size_of_val(&amp;r));&#10;    println!(&quot;&amp;[i32] size: {}&quot;, mem::size_of::&lt;&amp;[i32]&gt;());&#10;    println!(&quot;&amp;dyn ToString size: {}&quot;, mem::size_of::&lt;&amp;dyn ToString&gt;());&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use std::mem;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let s = \"hello\";</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let r: &#x26;str = s;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"&#x26;i32 size: {}\", mem::size_of::&#x3C;&#x26;i32>());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"&#x26;str size: {}\", mem::size_of_val(&#x26;r));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"&#x26;[i32] size: {}\", mem::size_of::&#x3C;&#x26;[i32]>());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"&#x26;dyn ToString size: {}\", mem::size_of::&#x3C;&#x26;dyn ToString>());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"零成本抽象示例\">零成本抽象示例</h2><p>Rust 的迭代器链在编译后与手写循环性能相同——这就是零成本抽象。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"fn sum_even_squares_iter(data: &amp;[i32]) -&gt; i32 {&#10;    data.iter()&#10;        .filter(|&amp;&amp;x| x % 2 == 0)&#10;        .map(|&amp;x| x * x)&#10;        .sum()&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn sum_even_squares_loop(data: &amp;[i32]) -&gt; i32 {&#10;    let mut sum = 0;&#10;    for &amp;x in data {&#10;        if x % 2 == 0 {&#10;            sum += x * x;&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;    sum&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fn sum_even_squares_iter(data: &#x26;[i32]) -> i32 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data.iter()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .filter(|&#x26;&#x26;x| x % 2 == 0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .map(|&#x26;x| x * x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .sum()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn sum_even_squares_loop(data: &#x26;[i32]) -> i32 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut sum = 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for &#x26;x in data {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if x % 2 == 0 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            sum += x * x;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    sum</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>两个函数在 <code>--release</code> 模式下编译出几乎完全相同的机器码。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"内存布局调试工具\">内存布局调试工具</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>命令</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>std::mem::size_of::&lt;T&gt;()</code></td>\n<td>查看类型大小</td>\n<td>代码内调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>std::mem::align_of::&lt;T&gt;()</code></td>\n<td>查看类型对齐</td>\n<td>代码内调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>#[cfg(test)]</code> + assert</td>\n<td>编译期验证布局</td>\n<td>单元测试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>cargo-bloat</code></td>\n<td>查看二进制大小分布</td>\n<td><code>cargo bloat --release</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"#[cfg(test)]&#10;mod tests {&#10;    use std::mem;&#10;&#10;    #[test]&#10;    fn test_layout() {&#10;        assert_eq!(mem::size_of::&lt;Option&lt;&amp;i32&gt;&gt;(), 8);&#10;        assert_eq!(mem::size_of::&lt;Option&lt;Box&lt;i32&gt;&gt;&gt;(), 8);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>#[cfg(test)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>mod tests {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    use std::mem;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[test]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn test_layout() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assert_eq!(mem::size_of::&#x3C;Option&#x3C;&#x26;i32>>(), 8);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assert_eq!(mem::size_of::&#x3C;Option&#x3C;Box&#x3C;i32>>>(), 8);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>默认布局下编译器可自由重排字段以最小化大小；<code>#[repr(C)]</code> 保证 FFI 兼容，<code>#[repr(packed)]</code> 去除填充，<code>#[repr(transparent)]</code> 实现 newtype。</li>\n<li>空位优化让 <code>Option&lt;&amp;T&gt;</code>、<code>Option&lt;Box&lt;T&gt;&gt;</code> 与内部类型同大小，是无成本的安全抽象范例。</li>\n<li>胖指针（<code>&amp;str</code>、<code>&amp;[T]</code>、<code>&amp;dyn Trait</code>）占 16 字节，额外字段携带长度或虚表指针。</li>\n<li>ZST（<code>()</code>、<code>PhantomData&lt;T&gt;</code>、标记结构体）不占内存但在类型系统中承载语义。</li>\n<li>迭代器链与手写循环在 release 模式下编译结果几乎一致，这是&quot;零成本抽象&quot;最直观的证据。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"内存布局与零成本抽象","id":"内存布局与零成本抽象"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"类型的内存大小","id":"类型的内存大小"},{"level":2,"text":"结构体布局与 repr","id":"结构体布局与-repr"},{"level":2,"text":"枚举布局与判别式","id":"枚举布局与判别式"},{"level":2,"text":"零大小类型（ZST）","id":"零大小类型-zst"},{"level":2,"text":"胖指针","id":"胖指针"},{"level":2,"text":"零成本抽象示例","id":"零成本抽象示例"},{"level":2,"text":"内存布局调试工具","id":"内存布局调试工具"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"unsafe Rust 与 FFI","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-language/systems-programming/unsafe-and-ffi"},"next":{"title":"嵌入式与 no_std","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-language/systems-programming/embedded-and-nostd"}}